{"source":"Tanzil via Al Quran Cloud; French translation: Muhammad Hamidullah; recitation: Ali Al-Hudhaify","id":80,"name":"Abasa","arabic":"سُورَةُ عَبَسَ","count":42,"revelation":"Meccan","verses":[{"id":"80:1","number":5759,"verse":1,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","translation":"Il s'est renfrogné et il s'est détourné","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5759.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:2","number":5760,"verse":2,"arabic":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","translation":"parce que l'aveugle est venu à lui.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5760.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:3","number":5761,"verse":3,"arabic":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","translation":"Qui te dit: peut-être [cherche]-t-il à se purifier?","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5761.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:4","number":5762,"verse":4,"arabic":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","translation":"ou à se rappeler en sorte que le rappel lui profite?","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5762.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:5","number":5763,"verse":5,"arabic":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","translation":"Quant à celui qui se complaît dans sa suffisance (pour sa richesse)","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5763.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:6","number":5764,"verse":6,"arabic":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","translation":"tu vas avec empressement à sa rencontre.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5764.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:7","number":5765,"verse":7,"arabic":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","translation":"Or, que t'importe qu'il ne se purifie pas».","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5765.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:8","number":5766,"verse":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","translation":"Et quant à celui qui vient à toi avec empressement","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5766.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:9","number":5767,"verse":9,"arabic":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","translation":"tout en ayant la crainte,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5767.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:10","number":5768,"verse":10,"arabic":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","translation":"tu ne t'en soucies pas.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5768.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:11","number":5769,"verse":11,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","translation":"N'agis plus ainsi! Vraiment ceci est un rappel -","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5769.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:12","number":5770,"verse":12,"arabic":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","translation":"quiconque veut, donc, s'en rappelle -","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5770.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:13","number":5771,"verse":13,"arabic":"فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","translation":"consigné dans des feuilles honorées,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5771.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:14","number":5772,"verse":14,"arabic":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","translation":"élevées, purifiées,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5772.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:15","number":5773,"verse":15,"arabic":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ","translation":"entre les mains d'ambassadeurs","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5773.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:16","number":5774,"verse":16,"arabic":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ","translation":"nobles, obéissants.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5774.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:17","number":5775,"verse":17,"arabic":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","translation":"Que périsse l'homme! Qu'il est ingrat!","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5775.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:18","number":5776,"verse":18,"arabic":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","translation":"De quoi [Allah] l'a-t-Il créé?","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5776.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:19","number":5777,"verse":19,"arabic":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","translation":"D'une goutte de sperme, Il le crée et détermine (son destin):","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5777.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:20","number":5778,"verse":20,"arabic":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","translation":"puis Il lui facilite le chemin;","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5778.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:21","number":5779,"verse":21,"arabic":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","translation":"puis Il lui donne la mort et le met au tombeau;","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5779.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:22","number":5780,"verse":22,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","translation":"puis Il le ressuscitera quand Il voudra.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5780.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:23","number":5781,"verse":23,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","translation":"Eh bien non! [L'homme] n'accomplit pas ce qu'Il lui commande.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5781.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:24","number":5782,"verse":24,"arabic":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","translation":"Que l'homme considère donc sa nourriture:","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5782.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:25","number":5783,"verse":25,"arabic":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا","translation":"C'est Nous qui versons l'eau abondante,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5783.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:26","number":5784,"verse":26,"arabic":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا","translation":"puis Nous fendons la terre par fissures","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5784.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:27","number":5785,"verse":27,"arabic":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا","translation":"et y faisons pousser grains,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5785.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:28","number":5786,"verse":28,"arabic":"وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا","translation":"vignobles et légumes,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5786.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:29","number":5787,"verse":29,"arabic":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا","translation":"oliviers et palmiers,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5787.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:30","number":5788,"verse":30,"arabic":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا","translation":"jardins touffus,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5788.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:31","number":5789,"verse":31,"arabic":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","translation":"fruits et herbages,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5789.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:32","number":5790,"verse":32,"arabic":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","translation":"pour votre jouissance vous et vos bestiaux.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5790.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:33","number":5791,"verse":33,"arabic":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","translation":"Puis quand viendra le Fracas,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5791.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:34","number":5792,"verse":34,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","translation":"le jour où l'homme s'enfuira de son frère,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5792.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:35","number":5793,"verse":35,"arabic":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","translation":"de sa mère, de son père,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5793.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:36","number":5794,"verse":36,"arabic":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","translation":"de sa compagne et de ses enfants,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5794.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:37","number":5795,"verse":37,"arabic":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","translation":"car chacun d'eux, ce jour-là, aura son propre cas pour l'occuper.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5795.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:38","number":5796,"verse":38,"arabic":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","translation":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des visages rayonnants,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5796.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:39","number":5797,"verse":39,"arabic":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","translation":"riants et réjouis.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5797.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:40","number":5798,"verse":40,"arabic":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ","translation":"De même qu'il y aura, ce jour-là, des visages couverts de poussière,","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5798.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:41","number":5799,"verse":41,"arabic":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","translation":"recouverts de ténèbres.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5799.mp3","juz":30,"page":585},{"id":"80:42","number":5800,"verse":42,"arabic":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","translation":"Voilà les infidèles, les libertins.","audio":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.hudhaify/5800.mp3","juz":30,"page":585}],"licenseNotice":"Tanzil Quran Text\nCopyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project\nLicense: Creative Commons At